This is a clean reimplementation of the DIFFSSR architecture from the published paper
and reference code. Weight-compatible with the original pretrained checkpoint
(state_dict keys and parameter shapes match exactly for strict=True loading).

No code is shared between this baseline and any other module in this repository.
This directory is a frozen museum piece for reproduction purposes only.
